# text = Beheld from a distance , this wild combination of vivid brightness and solemn gloom ; these buildings , at one place darkened till they looked gigantic , at another lightened till they appeared ethereal ; these crowded groups , seeming one great moving mass gleaming at this point in radiant light , obscured at that in thick shadow , made up a whole so incongruous and yet so beautiful , so grotesque and yet so sublime , that the scene looked , for the moment , more like some inhabited meteor , half eclipsed by its propinquity to earth , than a mortal and material prospect .
