# text = Of the former man no characteristic remained but the expression of the stern , mournful eyes ; and these , the truthful interpreters of the indomitable mind whose emotions they seemed created to express , preserved , unaltered by suffering and unimpaired by time , the same look , partly of reflection , partly of defiance , and partly of despair , which had marked them in those past days when the temple was destroyed and the congregations of the Pagans dispersed .
