# text = Whatever his motives for speech , the impressive earnestness of his manner gave evidence of the depth and intensity of his emotions as he addressed the senator thus murmured the senator in entreating accents interrupted the Pagan , raising one arm authoritatively , as if to obstruct Vetranio from approaching the door stammered Vetranio , returning the stern and inquiring gaze of the Pagan with a bewildered , uneasy stare continued the old man , his sinister eyes dilating in anticipated triumph as he whispered close at the senator's ear He ceased .
