# text = When it is remembered that this elaborate plan of blockade was enforced against a place containing , at the lowest possible computation , twelve hundred thousand inhabitants , destitute of magazines for food within its walls , dependent for supplies on its regular contributions from the country without , governed by an irresolute senate , and defended by an enervated army , the horrors that now impended over the besieged Romans are as easily imagined as described .
