# text = It is more to the warriors , and to you , than the justice of revenge cried Hermanric entreatingly interrupted Goisvintha Deprived of all power of consideration by the violence of the emotions awakened in his heart by Goisvintha's wild revelations of the evil passion that consumed her , the young Goth , shuddering throughout his whole frame , and still averting his face , murmured in hoarse , unsteady accents cried Goisvintha , seizing the hand of Hermanric , and gazing with a look of fierce triumph on his disordered countenance cried the Goth .
