# text = When she saw that they were left together again , she advanced hesitatingly towards the young Goth , and looked up with an expression of mute inquiry into his face said she , after an interval of silence , in soft , clear , melancholy accents Her language and actions , simple as they were , were yet so new to Hermanric , whose experience of her sex had been almost entirely limited to the women of his own stern impassive nation , that he could only reply by a brief assurance of protection , when the suppliant awaited his answer .
