# text = Alas , my friend , when I consider the present fearful scarcity of our provision stores in the city , and the length of time that this accursed blockade may be expected to last , I am inclined to think that the gods alone know ( I mean St . Peter ) how much longer we may be enabled to give occupation to our digestions and employment to our cooks pursued the Prefect , after an interval , speaking with his mouth full of stewed peacock replied Vetranio sullenly repeated the Prefect faintly replied Vetranio , carelessly persisted the Prefect And in the excess of his astonishment the bewildered Prefect actually abandoned his stewed peacock , and advanced , wine-cup in hand , to obtain a nearer view of the features of his imperturbable host rejoined Vetranio coolly said the Prefect reprovingly retorted the Senator urged the astonished Pompeianus , turning from rebuke to expostulation said Vetranio with a sneer cried the Prefect , in tones of lament said Vetranio impatiently murmured the repulsed Prefect in soliloquy , as he mechanically resumed his place at the refreshment table he continued , addressing the Senator The Prefect waited anxiously for an answer , but Vetranio neither looked at him nor replied .
# sent_id = 1353
