# text = He felt that , in its petty sphere , the short life of the humble animal before him must have been the prey of crosses and disappointments , as serious to it , as the more severed and destructive afflictions of which he , in his existence , had been the victim ; and , as he watched the shadow-like movement of the little fluttering heart of the lizard , he experienced a cruel pleasure in perceiving that there were other beings in the creation , even down to the most insignificant , who inherited a part of his misery , and suffered a portion of his despair .
