# text = He pursued his employment with perfect impunity ; the darkness covered him from observation ; no one disturbed him by approaching the solitary scene of his operations ; and of the two sentinels who were placed near the part of the wall which was the centre of all his exertions , one remained motionless at the most distant extremity of his post , and the other paced restlessly backwards and forwards on the rampart , singing a wild , rambling son about war , and women , and wine , which , whatever liberty it might allow to his organs of perception , effectually hindered the vigilant exercise of his faculties of hearing .
