# text = Pointing to some food that lay in a corner of the tent , and to the country behind , he said to her , in broken and gloomy accents Until this moment , Antonina had kept her face hidden , and had remained still crouching on the ground ; motionless , save when a shudder ran through her frame as she listened to the loud , coarse jesting of the Goths ; and speechless , except that when Goisvintha sank senseless to the earth , she uttered an exclamation of terror .
