# text = The man's parched lips moved , opened , quivered ; his wild , hollow eyes brightened till they absolutely gleamed , but he seemed incapable of uttering a word ; his features became horribly convulsed , the foam gathered about his lips , he staggered forward and would have fallen to the ground , had not the king instantly caught him in his strong grasp , and placed him on the wooden chest that he had hitherto occupied himself muttered Alaric , as he took the skull cup , and poured some of the wine it contained down the stranger's throat .
