# text = He regarded the king with a bewildered stare , waving his hand tremulously backwards and forwards before his face , as if to clear some imaginary darkness off his eyes ; then his arm fell helpless by his side , his head drooped upon his breast , and he moaned out in low , vacant tones cried Alaric disdainfully groaned the man , staggering back against the side of the tent , and shrinking under the merciless words of the Goth like a slave under the lash answered the king No syllable of reply now escaped the stranger's lips , and after an interval of silence Alaric resumed , in tones divested of their former fiery irritation , and marked by a solemn earnestness that conferred irresistible dignity and force on every word that he uttered said he , pointing to the shield
