# text = Remembering that she was descended from a race of women who slew their wounded husbands , brothers , and sons with their own hands when they sought them after battle dishonoured by a defeat ; remembering that the fire of the old ferocity of such ancestors as these still burnt at her heart ; remembering all that she had hoped from Hermanric , and had plotted against Antonina ; estimating in all its importance the shock of the intelligence she now received , we are alike unwilling and unable to describe her emotions at this moment .
