# text = The next instant he tore himself from the girl's arms , the old hero - spirit of his conquering nation possessed every nerve in his frame , his eye brightened again gloriously with its lost warrior-light , his limbs grew firm , his face was calm , he confronted the Huns with a mien of authority and a smile of disdain , and , as he presented to them his defenceless breast , not the faintest tremor was audible in his voice , while he cried in accents of steady command The Huns rushed forward with fierce cries , and buried their swords in his body .
