# text = While he was thus engaged , while the remains of the gentleness of his childhood were thus awfully revived in the insanity of his age , a musical string wound round a small piece of gilt wood fell from its concealment in her bosom ; he snatched it from the ground -- it was the fragment of her broken lute , which had never quitted her since the night when , in her innocent grief , she had wept over it in her maiden bed-chamber .
