# text = Fully , freely , bitterly she wept , on the kindly and parent earth -- the patient , friendly ground that once bore the light footsteps of the first of a race not created for death ; that now holds in its sheltering arms the loved ones , whom , in mourning , we lay there to sleep ; that shall yet be bound to the farthermost of its depths , when the sun-bright presence of returning spirits shines over its renovated frame , and love is resumed in angel perfection at the point where death suspended it in mortal frailness repeated the Pagan vacantly , moving slowly away as he spoke .
