# text = The innate and innocent fortitude of disposition , which had made her patient under the rigour of her youthful education , and hopeful under the trials that assailed her on her banishment from her father's house ; which had never deserted her until the awful scenes of the past night of assassination and death rose in triumphant horror before her eyes ; and which , even then , had been suspended but not destroyed -- was now destined to regain its healing influence over her heart .
