# text = We shall perceive , as an astonishing instance of the inconsistencies of the human character , the spectacle of a whole people resolutely defying an overwhelming foreign invasion at their very doors , just at the period when they had fallen most irremediably from the highest position of national glory to the lowest depths of national degradation ; resisting an all-powerful enemy with inflexible obstinacy , for the honour of the Roman name , which they had basely dishonoured or carelessly forgotten for ages past .
