# text = The lamp of yellow glass , which burnt high above the body , threw over it a lurid and flickering light ; the eyes were open , the jaw had fallen , the long grey tresses drooped heavily on either side of the white hollow cheeks cried Vetranio , pointing to the corpse Fired by their host's example , recovered from their momentary awe , already inflamed by the mad recklessness of debauchery , the guests started from their couches , and with Bacchanalian shouts answered Vetranio's challenge .
