# text = It was an embodiment of a sorcerer's vision -- an apocalypse of sin triumphing over the world's last relics of mortality in the vaults of death cried Vetranio , when the tumult was lulled For some time before the disclosure of the corpse , the hunchback had been seated apart at the end of the banqueting-hall opposite the black - curtained recess , conning over the manuscript containing the list of questions and answers which formed the impious dialogue he was to hold , by the aid of his powers of ventriloquism , with the violated dead .
