# text = Hidden from men's eyes , like a foul reptile , in his lurking-place in the deserted temple -- now raving round his idols in the fury of madness , now prostrate before them in idiot adoration -- weaker for the interests of his worship , at the crisis of its fate , than the weakest child crawling famished through the streets -- the victim of his own evil machinations at the very moment when they might have led him to triumph -- the object of that worst earthly retribution , by which the wicked are at once thwarted , doomed , and punished , here as hereafter , through the agency of their own sins .
