# text = The old Roman spirit , which long years of voluntary frivolity and degradation had not yet entirely depraved , flushed his pale , wasted face as he spoke thus A momentary expression of wrath and indignation appeared on Alaric's features as he listened to this bold speech ; but it was almost immediately replaced by a scornful smile of derision he cried he exclaimed , advancing towards an enfeebled and disarmed guard of the Senate , who quailed beneath his fierce glance he loudly continued With a rough laugh , echoed by the warriors behind him , he flung his ponderous weapon as he spoke towards the wretched object of his sarcasm .
