# text = As her eyes travelled slowly from side to side over the moving throng ; as she thought on the time that might still elapse ere the discovery and death -- the martyrdom in the cause of blood -- which she expected and defied , would overtake her , her hands trembled beneath her robe , and she reiterated in whispers to herself Suddenly , as she looked from group to group among the departing people , her eyes became arrested by one object ; she instantly stepped forwards , then abruptly restrained herself and moved back where the crowd was still thick , gazing fixedly ever in the same direction .
