# text = His voice grew low and moaning ; the wreck of his memory -- wandering and uncontrollable -- floated back , far back , on the dark waters of the past ; and his tongue uttered fragments of words and phrases that he had murmured at his father's knees -- farewell , childish wishes that he had breathed in his mother's ear -- innocent , anxious questions which he had addressed to Macrinus , the high priest , when he first entered the service of the gods at Alexandria .
