# text = His boyish reveries -- the gentleness of speech and poetry of thought of his first youthful days , were now , by the unsearchable and arbitrary influences of his disease , revived in his broken words , renewed in his desolate old age of madness and crime , breathed out in unconscious mockery by his lips , while the foam still gathered about them , and the last flashes of frenzy yet lightened in his eyes .
