# text = This unnatural calmness of language and vividness of memory , this treacherous appearance of thoughtful , melancholy self-possession , would often continue through long periods , uninterrupted ; but , sooner or later , the sudden change came ; the deceitful chain of thought snapped asunder in an instant ; the word was left half uttered ; the wearied limbs started convulsively into renewed action ; and as the dream of violence returned and the dream of peace vanished , the madman rioted afresh in his fury ; and journeyed as his visions led him , round and round his temple sanctuary , and hither and thither , when the night was dark and death was busiest in Rome , among the expiring in deserted houses , and the lifeless in the silent streets .
