# text = Not in the hours when the good Christian succoured the then forsaken Pagan , wandering homeless in Rome , was the secret disclosed ; no chance word of it was uttered when the deceiver told the feigned relation of his life to the benefactor whom he was plotting to deceive , or when , on the first morning of the siege , the machinations of the servant triumphed over the confidence of the master : it was reserved to be revealed in the words of delirium , at the closing years of madness , when he who discovered it was unconscious of all that he spoke , and his eyes were blinded to the true nature of all that he saw ; when earthly voices that might once have called him back to repentance , to recognition , and to love , were become to him as sounds that have no meaning ; when , by a ruthless and startling fatality , it was on the brother who had wrought for the true faith that the whole crushing weight of the terrible disclosure fell , unpartaken by the brother who had wrought for the false !
