# text = The one chance of meeting the emergency that remained was to strip the Pagan temples of the mass of jewelled ornaments and utensils , the costly robes , the idols of gold and silver which they were known to contain , and which , under that mysterious hereditary influence of superstition , whose power it is the longest labour of truth to destroy , had remained untouched and respected , alike by the people and the senate , after the worship that they represented had been interdicted by the laws , and abandoned by the nation .
