# text = At the brief intervals when his bodily weariness overpowered him on his melancholy watch , it was observed by those around him that , even in his short dreaming clumbers , his face remained ever turned in the same direction , towards the head of the couch , as if drawn thither by some irresistible attraction , by some powerful ascendancy , felt even amid the deepest repose of sensation , the heaviest fatigue of the overlaboured mind , and worn , sinking heart .
