# text = But that this act should be followed by the senator's immediate separation of himself from the society of Numerian's daughter ; that she was to gain nothing after all from these lands which had evidently been bought at her instigation , but the authority over a little strip of garden ; and yet , the inviolability of this valueless privilege should be insisted on in such serious terms , and with such an imperative tone of command as the senator had never been known to use before -- these were inconsistencies which all Carrio's ingenuity failed to reconcile .
