# text = The man had been born and reared in vice ; vice had fed him , clothed him , freed him , given him character , reputation , power in his own small way -- he lived in it as in the atmosphere that he breathed ; to show him an action , referable only to a principle of pure integrity , was to set him a problem which it was hopeless to solve .
